        <p>A BOON TO HUMANITY.</p>
        <p>After longscontinued and diligent research, this much- needed tams has been found, and repeatedly tested by analysts, who declare it to be pure and harmless. This desirable preokration is that wel!known Vegetable Tonic nailed Gwil‘ms Brae 'Quinine Bitters, and it has gained uich a wi.leipread reput ttion for efficacy that many unprejudiced doctors, wno have given it a fai trial, freq.,ent,y recommend ft to their patients in cases of great Weakness, Nervousness, .or any distorder Of the digestivo or 4111114. GWIIyM Bvans' Quinine Bitters is so invariably efficacious and produces such satisfactory results, th t when once tried it is always recommended. It has proveo successful ‘s en all other mediciue, had failed o give relief. It has also In many aase been found to ba perm, merit v *emelt:Jai when other prepardlims at best only give temporary relief. Gwilym limas' Bitters Is purely vegets‘ble, and contains melther</p>
